# Gameplay reproduction for inc-p0h1 (Bestow Curse redesign), the PLAYER
# MENU code path this bead adds -- only reachable on the branch build --
# picking the FIRST of its three curses: a -6 penalty to one ability score.
# tools/keys/bestow-curse-menu-misfortune.keys and
# tools/keys/bestow-curse-menu-hesitation.keys are its siblings, one script
# per curse, because the hesitation curse needs the goblin left UNFROZEN
# (it must actually try, and fail, to act) while this one and the
# misfortune one want it frozen (so retaliation doesn't clutter the log).
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/bestow-curse-menu-ability.keys 1
#
# Wizard mode sets up the scenario, following tools/keys/sanctuary-strike.keys
# and tools/keys/lof-magic-missile.keys: a priest, Freeze Monsters (Wizard
# Mode Switches row 11) so the summoned goblin never acts on its own, Learn
# Any Spell for Bestow Curse (SP_KNOWN|SP_PRIMAL|SP_INNATE, src/Debug.cpp:862).
#
# The cast dumps the screen twice: once right after firing at the target, to
# quote the "-- Choose a Curse: --" menu itself and the "-- Choose an
# Ability: --" submenu before any key answers either, and once after the
# pick resolves, to quote the goblin's own Dump() showing the ability score
# actually moved. "You feel afflicted!" (EVictim->IPrint in lib/pspells.irh)
# never appears on screen for a monster victim: Creature::IPrint
# (src/Message.cpp:741) is a no-op stub (its body is commented out), so that
# line is silent for anyone but a player victim -- upstream/existing
# behaviour, not part of this bead. The Will Save roll (visible in the
# message log this script also dumps) and the Dump() delta are the actual
# evidence that the curse landed.

@include chargen-priest.keys
ESC

w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*10
SPACE
ESC

w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Bestow Curse"
ENTER

# --- curse 1: the -6 ability penalty, on the goblin placed east ---------
w
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "goblin"
RIGHT ENTER
@dump:goblin-east-summoned

w
@choose "Examine Nearby Things"
RIGHT
@dump:goblin-east-before
ESC

m
@choose "Bestow Curse"
RIGHT
ENTER
@dump:curse-menu

@choose "a -6 penalty to one ability score"
@dump:ability-menu

@choose "Strength"
@while "more --" SPACE
@dump:cast-ability

w
@choose "Examine Nearby Things"
RIGHT
@dump:goblin-east-after
ESC

v
@dump:message-log
@while "Messages" ESC

@quit
